ne!While working on 8th Floor only me, I often found myself thinking about those unfinished story fragments from Water of M. This isn’t a sequel or a prequel, but it finally gave me a chance to let a character I truly love “step into the light” again.If you enjoy the quiet, eerie, subtly pressuring atmosphere in 8th Floor only me, you may also like Water of M.🔗 Water of M is a more complete school-themed psychological horror experience, featuring puzzles, chases, combat, item collect","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-27T13:26:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1817483467036588","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:24Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4167610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:11Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4167610":"2026-10-22T15:02:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4167610":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4167890":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-22T15:02:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}}}
